characters on daytime television, and Fulton became the first soap opera actress to hire a publicist. Fulton left the series for brief periods of time over the years, but was a huge part of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-daytime-actresses-ever-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2025-01-03\\n---\\nSoap operas are where stars are born.\\n\\nDaytime veterans like Susan Lucci, Frances Reid, Rachel Ames and Eric Braeden know a thing or two about this, having made household names for themselves on such melodramas as All My Children, Days of Our Lives, General Hospital ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/tv/soap-stars-who-have-played-roles-for-40-years/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d2\"},\"ref\":\"d2\",\"snippet\":\" ... The character was announced on January 18, 2022, by Soaps.com. Soap Opera Digest later announced Christian's casting. Christian, best known for his Daytime Emmy Award nominated role as Derek Frye on All My Children, had a four episode guest stint in 2018. Christian was contacted by ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Days_of_Our_Lives_characters_introduced_in_the_2020s\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d4\"},\"ref\":\"d4\",\"snippet\":\" ... to \\\"entice viewers to tune into soap operas that they might not have usually watched,\\\" then-President of ABC Daytime Angela Shapiro orchestrated Dano's concurrent appearance as\\nGretel on the three other ABC daytime dramas at the time—All My Children, General Hospital, and Port Charles—in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Life_to_Live\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"acb751aa6dae784780a75f2e3713b0da4bd788bedf79579d756a4c72ce742824\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"54b09ce094b460aa5d31720f0d4155520bae7b1464fdc26443ad8b85983680b2\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"soap opera character married three times two children died one survives\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_1d6385b232814357959498d0"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... What Makes It Great\\n\\nThe series received positive responses for its fresh perspective on time-traveling from a female perspective. Claire is shown enjoying her married life when she is suddenly transported to an absurd time. She marries a dashing Scottish warrior named Jamie Fraser for protection as ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/best-tv-series-adapted-from-famous-novels/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... importance of either character _as people_.\\n\\nIt has to do with the fact that Jamie lives in much more interesting (read, dangerous, unpredictable, and to a large extent unfamiliar) times. Claire's post-war, 20th-century life without Jamie is, on the surface, not real interesting. Re-establishing ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.outlandercast.com/2018/05/outlander-the-starz-tv-show.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d52\"},\"ref\":\"d52\",\"snippet\":\" ... We were on another Canadian series together as well, called Arctic Air, our characters didn't have a lot of interaction but more so off-camera. When we got cast (for Outlander) we had such a great time and we got to do some exploring together, it was ... \",\"title\":\"http://www.absolutemusicchat.com/music-qa-sessions/in-conversation-with-sera-lys-mcarthur-actress-outlander-arctic-air/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... Fortunately for Ed, they were cast as Emily and George, the leads in their senior class play \\\"Our Town\\\". Ed and Barbara were married in real life after they graduated from the University of Kentucky in June 1954.\\n\\nPrior to earning a B.S. degree in the Business ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/date/02-29/births\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... 3 Outlander (2014–Present)\\n\\nWritten by Diana Gabaldon\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nOutlander follows Claire Randall, a married nurse from 1945, who is transported back to 1743 Scotland. Amidst political intrigue and danger, she navigates life in the past and becomes torn between loyalty to her ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/best-romance-tv-shows-based-on-books/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"39f31d9c990ac2701897e05b296ab77dd566364473984a00e91287464cc1c1a2\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"121d99b5eb59eb1b6ad23c138b42a1863b16642612cb0880b43cd552bec28095\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Outlander cast real life relatives char